    "text": "By Ben J. Costas ,\n10 hours ago A 63-year-old woman was found dead inside her East Village apartment Tuesday afternoon, and San Diego police say the circumstances surrounding her death are unusual enough that the department’s Homicide Unit has taken over the case. Officers were called to a residence on 17th Street around 2 p.m. after the discovery, and investigators are now working to figure out exactly what happened. Read full article",
